{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/headercrop.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the old castle of the renowned inventor Heinrich Von Schinker, in northern England, Heinrich's spirit returns as a small ghost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside a mysterious bubble that he can move with gentle blows, he must face his own out-of-control inventions and fierce wild animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guiding the bubble to freedom is his only goal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/encuentro.gif?t=1746774498\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/ENG_BannerText_Game_resize.png?t=1746774498\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge Your Skills</strong></h2>Overcome levels filled with dangers and puzzles that will test your abilities. With addictive gameplay and devilish difficulty, your only goal is to protect the bubble at all costs.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defeat Epic Bosses</strong></h2>Face fierce bosses that will make you sweat. Only the most skilled will emerge victorious.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/bosses.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relive the Original Classic</strong></h2>Enjoy the full remaster of the 90s game, with 36 original levels recreated with completely renewed art.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/retro.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Compete for Glory</strong></h2>Perfect your times in speedrun mode and submit your results online to secure your place in the prestigious Hall of Fame.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/speedrun.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/ENG_BannerText_Info_resize.png?t=1746774498\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Enjoy an adventure with over 40 levels filled with skill and clever puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Three difficulty levels tailored to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Completely revamped graphics and sound that bring the magical world of the castle to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dive deep into Heinrich's story by finding hidden collectibles throughout the castle chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Upload your scores and compare them with the best players worldwide in the online ranking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover secret rooms, alternative endings, and unlock challenging in-game achievements.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/bat.gif?t=1746774498\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/separador.png?t=1746774498\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You Did It!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2412240/c11ad3490db44397cecf79d60b064e2099026757.jpg"},{"name":"Your Heroism Will Be Remembered!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/imag