bosses that will make you sweat. Only the most skilled will emerge victorious.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/bosses.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Relive the Original Classic</strong></h2>Enjoy the full remaster of the 90s game, with 36 original levels recreated with completely renewed art.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/retro.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Compete for Glory</strong></h2>Perfect your times in speedrun mode and submit your results online to secure your place in the prestigious Hall of Fame.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/speedrun.gif?t=1746774498\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/ENG_BannerText_Info_resize.png?t=1746774498\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Enjoy an adventure with over 40 levels filled with skill and clever puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Three difficulty levels tailored to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Completely revamped graphics and sound that bring the magical world of the castle to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dive deep into Heinrich's story by finding hidden collectibles throughout the castle chambers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Upload your scores and compare them with the best players worldwide in the online ranking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover secret rooms, alternative endings, and unlock challenging in-game achievements.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/bat.gif?t=1746774498\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/extras/separador.png?t=1746774498\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Nakama Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412240/header.jpg?t=1746774498","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Nakama Games Studio S.L.  All Rights Reserved. Bubble Ghost is a licensed Trademark of Vidibond S.L. Bubble Ghost is a registered Trademark of Mr Christophe Andreani. Published by SelectaPlay. SelectaPlay is a registered Trademark of SelectaVisi\u2002n S.L.U. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120534,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120534/movie480.mp4?t=1743438704","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120534/movie_max.mp4?t=1743438704"},"name":" Bubble Ghost Remake","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120534/80c936eeac89127cb1a43a8b9b75734fe10688d1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743438704","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120534/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743438704","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120534/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743438704"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257074630,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074630/movie480.mp4?t=1731938596","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074630/movie_max.mp4?t=1731938596"},"name":"Demo announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257074630/ce49e93ec063c1cc1238b0f3d6d32a0dc0538de0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1731938596","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257074630/movie480_vp9.webm?t=173